# Robot 1, auto 1 "R1 Right Corner: Launch, Park Right" (autos/RightCornerLaunchAndPark.java), as RED
# (BLUE is the same route from the blue wall: the field is turned, not mirrored). From the start spot it fires the four
# preloaded POLLEN at our HIVE's up CELL (realistic scatter), then slides to the right corner of our
# LOADING ZONE (turning to face left on the way), touching nothing: LEAVE 3 + PARK 5.
# How many shots score depends on the shot angle and speed in the robot file (estimates until measured):
# at 3750 RPM (an estimate for the real robot) the simulator misses: its ramp and shot are estimates, so
# this file checks that all four are FIRED and prints the verdicts and the score; it does not demand CELL points.
# Run it: the "Simulator tests" button in Android Studio (all tests), or from the ftc-helper-lib folder:
#   ./gradlew :sim:scenario -Pfile=../simulator/scenarios/r1-auto.sim
robot ../robot.properties
set scatter realistic
init "R1 Right Corner: Launch, Park Right"
press g1.b                                 # RED
wait 0.5                                   # the robot is placed on the chosen side
expect screen has "Place robot : Back corner on wall 20.5in from R, front at HIVE"
expect robot x = 51.6 0.3                    # the start spot (RED: the simulator's field numbers are ours)
expect robot y = -58.5 0.3                # back-left corner on the red wall (G304)
expect robot heading = 37.8 1              # the front (the ramp) aimed at the HIVE's up CELL
expect stored = 4                          # four preloaded
expect shape intake_arm = 85 0.1           # folded (inside the 18 in cube)
start
expect within 1 shape intake_arm = 85 0.1  # still folded: it would fall onto the wall here
expect within 12 launched >= 4             # all four fired
expect stored = 0
expect within 6 shape intake_arm = 220 0.1    # pushed over while it drives off the wall
expect within 20 screen has "To the LOADING ZONE"   # the last step is running...
expect time < 25                           # ...well inside the 30 s (seconds since START)
expect within 5 phase STOPPED              # and the autonomous ends by itself
wait 0.5
expect screen has "Fire 2 at 3750 RPM: done (2 fired)"
expect screen has "Bump back: done"
expect screen has "Fire all at 3750 RPM: done (4 fired)"   # the count is all fired so far
expect screen has "To the LOADING ZONE: done"
expect screen not "skipped"                # no step skipped or cut short for park time
expect screen not "cut short"
expect bumped none                         # touched no wall or field element on the way
# Parked at the right corner of the red LOADING ZONE (x -46.6..-23.9, y up to -59.1): beside the zone,
# only the robot's corner over the zone's corner, which is a PARK; the zone stays free.
expect robot y > -58
expect robot y < -50
expect robot x > -26
expect robot x < -19
expect robot heading = 90 5
expect points "red" >= 18                  # 10 already on the field for red + LEAVE 3 + PARK 5 (+ TELEOP park now)
print pieces                               # the shots' verdicts and the score
expect error none
